{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56392","headline":"寄远 · 崔公远","name":"寄远","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君今远戍在何处？\n遣妾秋来长望天。\n（均见《吟窗杂录》卷三十《古今才妇》）（按：《全唐诗》卷八百一收四句，缺题，故重录之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔公远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56392.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56392","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}